The PB236 sends a panic alarm to the mobile app by simply pressing the button on the device. You can also send a panic alarm by cord — one kind of cord has a button, the other doesn't, customizable according to your demand.

## Key Features

- ZigBee 3.0, compatible with other ZigBee products
- Sends panic alarm to the mobile app
- Pull cord for easy emergency alarms
- Low power consumption (standby <3μA)
- Low voltage alarm at 2.4V
